Package: kestrel-browser
Version: 0.1.0
Section: web
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: libgtk-4-1, libwebkitgtk-6.0-1, adwaita-icon-theme
Maintainer: Kestrel Team <salim77007j@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/salim77007j/kestrel-browser
Description: Fast, private, lightweight web browser
 Kestrel is an independent browser with a memory-safe Rust core, GTK4 UI and
 WebKitGTK rendering. It ships with network-level ad & tracker blocking
 (compiled content filters), cosmetic filtering, anti-fingerprinting,
 third-party cookie control, WebRTC protection, a private mode, an OS-keyring
 password vault and full tab/session management — with a tiny resource
 footprint.
